# Recovery Runbook Inventory

Inventory of recovery runbooks per service with the service name and the objectives each runbook implements.

## Scope reference — CONT-17: Business continuity plan reviewed
Requirement addressed: The business continuity plan is reviewed and approved once a year and covers every managed service.

- Plan title: Recorded in EV-040 (Recovery Runbook Inventory).
- Review date: 2026-04-02.
- Approver name: Managing Director.
- Services covered: Recorded in EV-040 (Recovery Runbook Inventory).

## Scope reference — CONT-18: Recovery objectives defined per service
Requirement addressed: Every managed service has an approved recovery time objective and recovery point objective.

- Service name: Recorded in EV-040 (Recovery Runbook Inventory).
- Recovery time objective: Recorded in EV-040 (Recovery Runbook Inventory).
- Recovery point objective: Recorded in EV-040 (Recovery Runbook Inventory).
- Approval date: 2026-04-02.

Signed: Managing Director (2026-04-09)
